                "Choose exactly one opaque option_id from the server-owned option_ids enum based on the character context.",
                "The selected server-owned Insight priority array must have exactly required_count entries and must replace the unavailable Insight at the frozen target CL.",
                "The server owns every presented Insight ID and legality constraint; do not compose IDs, mechanics, or a full character response yourself.",
